            "review_title": "Review at Summer Crab - Seafood And Bar",
            "review_text": "Quy Ha\nPhu Quoc Island, Vietnam11 contributions\n1\nMemorable meal\nNov 2020\nWe had a sumptuous seafood meal in this restaurant. The squids and giant mantis prawns were very fresh and thus it became the most memorable meals in Summer Crab. Price was reasonable for such fresh food was excellent from the seafood dishes to the vegetable ones everything was very tasty. The staff were exceptional, very friendly, helpful and polite. Cleanliness was great too, would highly recommend eating here . Just brilliant all round\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 11, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
