            "review_title": "Review at Summer Crab - Seafood And Bar",
            "review_text": "lych\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam7 contributions\n0\nBeach vibes seafood restaurant in middle of Saigon\nOct 2020\nI came here along due to the restaurant look very nice. The decoration, music and vibes make your feeling like you are on the beach. Food are great too, fresh, tasty, the thing i love is the grilled platter. You can have a combo with mackezel, shirmp, squid together and drink craft beer. Very good combination. Highly recommend!!\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 29, 2020",
